Description: Co-expression network analysis for high dimensional
    transcriptomics data such as single-cell and spatial RNA sequencing.
    Builds on 'WGCNA' and integrates with 'Seurat' to aggregate cells into
    metacells or metaspots, infer co-expression networks, identify gene
    modules, and compute module eigengenes and intramodular connectivity.
    Downstream analyses include differential module expression, module-trait
    correlation, module preservation and projection across datasets, gene set
    enrichment, and transcription factor regulatory networks. The method is
    described in Morabito et al. (2023) <doi:10.1016/j.crmeth.2023.100498>.
